OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with some clear spells but
OL,7,Fwith reshening southwest winds.
OL,8,FRemaining dry over night and largely
OL,9,Fclear, with rather breezy conditions
OL,10,Ffor Shetland, and lighter winds over
OL,11,FOrkney.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry throughout the day on
OL,14,FMonday with some good sunny spells.
OL,15,FGradually clouding over during the
OL,16,Fevening. Fresh southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
