OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTurning widely cloudier on Tuesday and
OL,7,Frather breezy, with an increasing risk
OL,8,Fof rain later especially Orkney.
OL,9,FRemaining cloudy with some rain on
OL,10,FWednesday. Bright spells and showers
OL,11,Fon Thursday.
